RELEASE/
CONFIG.local.BAT
# examples/*/GAME.XBN was ignored while the kit stayed artifact-free;
# owner decision 2026-08-14: prebuilt example binaries SHIP (same
# rationale as videnc.exe below - the kit works without the toolchain).
# tests/build-tests.ps1's -XbnTicker/-XbnFade staging asserts the
# committed binaries match a fresh assembly of their source, so they
# cannot silently go stale.

# tools\ skeleton: keep the empty folders (.gitkeep) and README, but ignore any
# tool binaries a maintainer extracts into it locally. videnc.exe is the one
# SHIPPED tool binary (first-party, built from lib\videnc.py - owner decision
# 2026-07-23): tracked so the kit works without Python out of the box.
tools/**/*
!tools/**/
!tools/**/.gitkeep
!tools/README.txt
!tools/videnc/videnc.exe
!tools/vidtune/vidtune.exe
